cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Results
  derived from it additionally rest on Copernicus Sentinel-2 data and the
  Microsoft Planetary Computer; please credit both (see notes).
title: "Orbital Earth Observation Platform"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McWain
    given-names: Gordon
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/raveheart1/Orbital-Earth-Observation-Platform"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raveheart1/Orbital-Earth-Observation-Platform"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - earth observation
  - NDVI
  - Sentinel-2
  - STAC
  - remote sensing
notes: >-
  Analyses produced by this software contain modified Copernicus Sentinel
  data, processed by ESA, accessed via the Microsoft Planetary Computer.
  When citing results, please also cite the Copernicus Sentinel-2 mission
  (European Space Agency) and the Microsoft Planetary Computer as the data
  access provider.
